      "role": "user",
      "content": "I'm reviewing a claim for a warehouse fire in Rotterdam. Can you give me a breakdown of the primary risk factors associated with storing flammable industrial solvents in high-density racking systems? I need to focus on how the storage configuration impacts fire spread and suppression efficacy.",
